# Pionex Layout Editor — Reverse Engineering & Implementierungsplan

## Quelle
Screenshot der Pionex Web-Trading-Oberfläche (de.trading.pionex.com)

## Was Pionex macht

### Layout-Struktur
```
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│ HEADER: Logo | Spot ▼ | Futures ▼ | RWA ▼ | Markets | Earn ▼ | ...    │
