Same SwiftUI checklist UI as v1 (SecurityChecklistView with numbered German steps + progress {id: Int} persisted to defaults) — the step list changes to the single-device essentials, and step order changes because the Screen-Time-Code is now your most important line of defense:

Bildschirmzeit-Code festlegen (new #1) — Einstellungen › Bildschirmzeit › „Bildschirmzeit-Code verwenden“. This code belongs to the parent only; it guards Content & Privacy Restrictions and the Screen Time section where Family Controls access could otherwise be revoked. Add Apple-ID recovery.
